# WalletKit review policy.
#
# `main` and `v25` require zero approving reviews with "require review from code
# owners" enabled, so a review is only required for the paths listed below.
# Everything else is intentionally left unowned: those pull requests can be merged
# without a review while `.github/workflows/small-change-gate.yml` passes, which
# asks for a review as soon as the change is larger than 500 lines.
#
# Keep this list narrow. A wildcard owner gates every pull request, and bypassing
# it then becomes the normal way to merge.

